  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDB-WAEMU Rural Water Supply and Sanitation Project in Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to provide sustainable access to water supply and sanitation services to remote villages and rural communities in the regions of Matam, Tambacounda, Kedougou and Kolda in Senegal while creating economic and social Growth Poles around off-grid village mini solar-powered water systems that will additionally support access to electricity, income-earning opportunities and food security.</narrative>
  </description>
